# Code owners for IntelFeed — all three collaborators with push access.
#
# This file only has teeth once "Require review from Code Owners" is enabled
# for `main` in Settings > Branches. Without that, GitHub still auto-requests
# review from the owners below, it just does not block the merge.
#
# One rule listing three owners requests review from all three but is
# satisfied by any ONE of their approvals — it is not a three-sign-off gate.
# GitHub also never requests review from a PR's own author, so a PR from any
# one of them can be approved by either of the other two.
#
# Rules are last-match-wins, not cumulative — a later line that matches a path
# replaces the owners of an earlier one rather than adding to them. Any
# narrower rule added below the catch-all must therefore re-list every owner
# who should still own those paths.

